\
Machine Learning:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
One of the most common ways of training AI models is with machine learning, a technique that enables a tool to find patterns and learn from data on its own. It doesn\'92t even need to be programmed for every possible scenario.\
For example, let\'92s say someone wants to use AI to sort zebras from horses.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 After being trained with machine learning, AI can then identify zebras from photos that weren't in its training set. This process is called inference.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Approaches to machine learning\
There are three common machine learning approaches used to develop AI:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Supervised learning is used to train AI from a large dataset that has been labeled by people. This technique is often used when there is a specific, known output in mind.\'a0\cb1 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl1\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
For example, a model is trained on millions of pictures that a person has explicitly labeled zebra or horse. AI learns the specific characteristics of each animal so it can automatically sort new images into those predefined categories.\'a0\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Unsupervised learning is used to train AI from a dataset that has not been labeled by people. This technique is used to identify patterns and structures in data when there isn't a specific, known output in mind.\'a0\cb1 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl1\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
For example, a model analyzes a large, unlabeled dataset of photos containing horses and zebras. Without being told what a zebra is, the AI discovers patterns on its own, like striped or solid, and clusters images with similar features together.\'a0\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reinforcement learning is used to train AI through a trial-and-error process that is guided by a reward system. This technique is used to continuously refine how AI approaches a specific task or goal.\'a0\cb1 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl1\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
For example, a model is tasked with identifying zebras in a video. It has not received any training, so it has to make a guess. Each time the model guesses correctly, it receives a "positive reward.\'94 If the guess is wrong, it receives a "penalty." Over many attempts, AI learns to adjust its strategy to maximize its total reward, gradually mastering the task through experience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The constraint of knowledge cutoff\
Knowledge cutoff is the point in time when a model\'92s training data ends. This means the model lacks information on events, discoveries, or data that occurred after that date.\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 To work effectively with a model's knowledge cutoff, you can use these techniques:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Look up the cutoff: You can search online for the knowledge cutoff date of a specific AI tool. This helps you understand the boundary of its internal knowledge.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Verify time-sensitive information: For any statistics, breaking news, or details about recent events, always cross-reference AI's answer with a reliable external source, like a search engine or an official report.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Specify your timeframe: When asking about a topic that changes over time, state the timeframe for what you need. For example, instead of "What was the biggest song of the summer?" ask \'93What was the biggest song of the summer in 2025?\'94\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Refine with follow-up prompts: If an answer seems outdated, like calling a product new when it is several years old, use a follow-up prompt to ask for more recent alternatives or clarification.\cb1 \
\pard\tx720\tx1440\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Changes in AI\'92s performance over time\
Drift is the gradual decline in a model\'92s accuracy and relevance as the real world changes. You might observe drift in two ways:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Factual drift: This is when AI becomes less accurate over time because of its knowledge cutoff. For example, an AI model's advice on current fashion trends may become less useful the further you get from its training date.\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Behavioral drift: This refers to changes in AI\'92s behavior over time. As developers update models, you might notice that the formatting, tone, or conversational style changes, even when you use the same prompts.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Here are a few ways to manage and mitigate both kinds of drift:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Provide accurate and up-to-date context in your prompts, especially for topics that change quickly, like market trends or technology.\cb1 \
\ls4\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Keep chats focused by starting a new conversation for each specific task. This also helps to reset the context window if a conversation becomes too long or the output starts to feel off topic.\cb1 \
\ls4\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Be explicit with clear and specific instructions in your prompts.\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
